  "gong_plates": {
    "id": 45485,
    "name": "Shruthi Thali/Gong Plates",
    "slug": "shruthi-thali-gong-plates",
    "description": "<p>Experience the profound resonance and therapeutic effects of our Shruthi Thali also known as Gong plates, crafted to bring harmonic balance and transformation to sound healing practice.<br />\nThese tuned sonic plates and bells are calibrated to the complete musical scale in the 4th octave\u2014C, D, E, F, G, A, B\u2014and also available as a complete set of 7.<br />\nEach piece has been meticulously crafted to produce pure tones that can add a new soundscape to your musical journeys.</p>\n<p>The Shruthi Thali ranges in size from the larger 12.5 inch by 8.5 tuned inch plate tuned to C4 to the more compact 10 inch by 6.5 inch version tuned to B4, with weights varying between 2kg for the C4 plate and 1.24kg for the Smaller B4 plate.<br />\nEach set includes an elegantly designed wooden holder and plate, a cover and a mallet creating both a functional sound instrument and a beautiful addition to your sacred or therapeutic environment.</p>\n<p>Elevate your sonic healing practice with this extraordinary set designed to attune your surroundings to the fundamental harmonies of existence.</p>",
    "short_description": "<p>Experience the profound resonance and therapeutic effects of our Shruthi Thali also known as Gong plates, crafted to bring harmonic balance and transformation to sound healing practice.<br />\nThese tuned sonic plates and bells are calibrated to the complete musical scale in the 4th octave\u2014C, D, E, F, G, A, B\u2014and also available as a complete set of 7.<br />\nEach piece has been meticulously crafted to produce pure tones that can add a new soundscape to your musical journeys.</p>\n<p>The Shruthi Thali ranges in size from the larger 12.5 inch by 8.5 tuned inch plate tuned to C4 to the more compact 10 inch by 6.5 inch version tuned to B4, with weights varying between 2kg for the C4 plate and 1.24kg for the Smaller B4 plate.<br />\nEach set includes an elegantly designed wooden holder and plate, a cover and a mallet creating both a functional sound instrument and a beautiful addition to your sacred or therapeutic environment.</p>\n<p>Elevate your sonic healing practice with this extraordinary set designed to attune your surroundings to the fundamental harmonies of existence.</p>",
