  "solar": {
    "id": 49816,
    "name": "Solar Bell",
    "slug": "solar-bell",
    "description": "<p>Resonate with the healing power of 528 Hz.<br data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"175\" />Experience deep balance, clarity, and inner harmony with every tone.</p>",
    "short_description": "<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"363\">Our Solar Bell is a beautifully crafted sound healing instrument designed to elevate your meditation and relaxation practices. Inspired by ancient traditions and often associated with sacred frequencies, solar bells are known to support energetic alignment and inner harmony.</p>\n<p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"731\">While many solar bells are traditionally tuned to 432 Hz, our Solar Bell is precisely tuned to <strong data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"470\">528 Hz</strong> \u2014 a frequency often referred to as the \u201clove frequency,\u201d believed to encourage transformation, balance, and deep healing. Subtle design influences inspired by ancient Egyptian cosmology add a symbolic dimension, connecting sound with timeless spiritual wisdom.</p>\n<p data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"960\">With a compact size of <strong data-start=\"756\" data-end=\"767\">19.5 cm</strong>, this Solar Bell is easy to handle and perfect for personal rituals, sound baths, or therapeutic sessions. It comes complete with a mallet, allowing you to begin your sound journey right away.</p>",
    "prices": {
      "price": "1265000",
      "regular": "1534000",
      "sale": "1265000"
    },
    "images": [
